    "body": "Looks already fixed on upstream/main c310c4f61: concurrent_trace_callers_keep_the_gpu_lifecycle_safe passes without a change. Suggest closing; the maintainer decides.\n\nThe pin ran four concurrent callers. Each caller traced twice through the unchanged helpers. All eight Vulkan device initializations used llvmpipe. The test passed in 1.54 seconds.\n\nThe failed run contains no assertion diagnostic. This passing pin does not exclude an intermittent driver failure. I did not identify a fixing commit.\n\nSTOPPED: The required pin did not fail. Claim released. No fix or PR was made. The test log is local at /tmp/issue-3111-pin-red.log.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
