    "body": "One more red test on upstream/main 211105042, found by the quick gate of #2898. It is not in the run above.\n\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-app --test default_machine_missing` fails `a_missing_default_machine_file_refuses_the_post_per_operation` at `crates/app/tests/default_machine_missing.rs:160` with \"the mounted operation has its own machine\".\n- It fails with the unchanged upstream `circular.rs` too, so the #2898 change does not cause it.\n- The test came in near #3092 (default machine for an operation).\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
