    "body": "Bisected: `motion: vertical_arc_entry` passes on 96b22c84d^1 and fails from 96b22c84d (merge of #3053). #3053's lead_fit change applies to every closed contour, not only rings with tabs: on a plain rectangle the seam moves to mid-edge and the G18 entry arc reverses; the oblique first cut loses its chord fan. Revert PR: #3114 (both vertical_arc_entry suites green on its head). #3019 reopened to redo it narrowly.",
